              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "PASS WHEN · the rectangle is mint on the canvas and on the pill's colour disc, and still mint after the reload · the arrow's Line style popover shows the weights beside the dashes under one hairline, and the arrow is thick and dashed · the mixed selection's pill reads “2 selected” with “1 Block” before S P E"
